                    {
                        "step": "Do not adjust the pH."
                    },
                    {
                        "step": "For plates add 8g/l Gelrite or 15g Phytagel and 1g/L MgCl. A carbon source is not required because the organism degrades the polysaccharides in Gelrite or Phytagel"
