                    {
                        "step": "For liquid medium use 0.8-2.0g/l Gelrite as carbon source (the medium remains liquid). Alternatively mannose (1g/l) may be used instead of Gelrite in liquid medium. Do not add mannose to solid media, which will inhibit growth."
